 County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 44% of normal in October to November and 196% in May to June. Grid 14578 shows a preliminary 78.8 for July to August 2026, which is an estimate from NOAA rain and not RMA&rsquo;s final index. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, with grid 14278 at 51%.</p>"}
